@@ -0,0 +1,77 @@
+# Activities
+
+Activities are the account timeline events: cards being added, moved, assigned,
+closed, or renamed, along with comments. Only activity from boards the current user
+can access is returned.
+
+Deprecated `card_collection_changed` events are omitted.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated list of activities, newest first.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by user ID(s) who performed the activity |
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+[
+  {
+    "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohde",
+    "action": "card_assigned",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+    "description": "David assigned JZ to &quot;First!&quot;",
+    "particulars": {
+      "assignee_ids": ["03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"]
+    },
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/1",
+    "eventable_type": "Card",
+    "eventable": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohdb",
+      "number": 1,
+      "title": "First!",
+      "status": "published",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/1"
+    },
+    "board": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "name": "Fizzy",
+      "all_access": true,
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "creator": { "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7", "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson" }
+    },
+    "creator": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+      "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+      "role": "owner",
+      "active": true,
+      "email_address": "david@example.com",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+    }
+  }
+]
+```
+
+`eventable`, `board`, and `creator` use the same representations as the cards,
+comments, boards, and users endpoints.
+
+`url` opens the card. For comment events, it opens the card where the comment was
+posted and jumps to that comment.
+
+__Particulars:__
+
+| Action | Particulars |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned` | `assignee_ids` |
+| `card_board_changed` | `old_board`, `new_board` |
+| `card_title_changed` | `old_title`, `new_title` |
+| `card_triaged` | `column` |
+| Other actions | Empty object |
+
+Missing board, title, or column values are returned as empty strings.
